"For the map L∆and for the training set S, with #(S) = N, there exists a weight vector ˆθ ∈Θ, and a resulting neural network of the form Lθ, with Θ ⊂RM and M = O(d + N), such that the following holds, L∆(z) = Lˆθ(z), ∀z ∈S.",
