"Discussion Remarkably, in the controlled experiments, we observed that the number of parameters in the base model could be reduced by half; yet, the global adaptive ﬁltering layer al- lows to ‘catch up’ with the lost parameters and to reach the level of the base models that have twice as many param- eters.",
The result generalize well across different datasets of various scales and across CV tasks.,
