Erasing metric choice.,
"At the moment, there are a lot of metrics for assessing the quality of denoising of various types.",
"However, there is no universal one that would accu- rately correspond to the assessment with the naked eye and is well interpreted in all cases [12].",
"The most suitable for our task was the FSIM metric, which uses the structure of the Fourier components of the image.",
"However, on a large number of examples (including those provided to you in the Fig.",
