Overall Challenges.,
"Within all of these topic areas in computer vision and machine learning, the challenges that must be addressed require addressing interesting questions such as determining the most appropriate sensors and data processing choices for specific questions, addressing dif- ficult domain transfer issues, considering how to integrate noisy side channels of information, such as genetic infor- mation that may conflict or conflate with each other, or deal- ing with nuisance parameters like environmental or weather variations that simultaneously influence plant subjects and the sensor data content.",
