We inject knowledge by conditioning the global proposal distribution TG on the image observation.,
We learn the informed proposal TG(·|ˆI) discriminatively in an ofﬂine training stage using a non- parametric density estimator described below.,
"The mixture parameter α ∈[0, 1] controls the contribution of each proposal, for α = 1 we recover MH.",
