This is to be expected since single variable up- dates will not traverse the multi-modal posterior distribu- tions fast enough due to the high correlation of the camera parameters.,
"In Figure 5 we plot the median auto-correlation of samples obtained by different sampling techniques, sepa- rately for each of the six extrinsic camera parameters.",
The informed sampling approach (INF-MH and INF-INDMH) appears to produce samples which are more independent compared to other baseline samplers.,
