Here the discriminative information is provided by a readily available heuristic in the OpenCV library.,
This experiment illustrates a variation of the informed sam- pling strategy that can be applied to sampling from high- dimensional distributions.,
Inference methods for general high-dimensional distributions is an active area of research and intrinsically difﬁcult.,
