"Examples In this section we give several simple examples of the random graph model we study; these examples are chosen to illustrate the deﬁnitions and the scope of the model, as well as various pathologies that may occur.",
"In sub- sequent sections we shall refer to several of these examples; in particular, many of our proofs will be based on the ‘ﬁnite-type’ case.",
