"Let κ be deﬁned by κ(1, 1) = κ(2, 2) = 0 and κ(1, 2) = κ(2, 1) = c. Then GV(n, κ) is the random bipartite graph G(n, n; c/n) with n vertices in each class, where each possible edge between classes is present with probability c/n, independently of the other edges.",
