"In the strictly subcritical case (∥Tκ∥< 1), all components are small, and our aim is to show that C1(Gn) = O(log n) whp.",
"We shall prove three results that together imply Theorem 3.12, namely Theorems 12.5, 12.6 and 12.7 below.",
