5 Conclusions We proposed an approach for the classification of breast cancer histology images based on convolution neural networks (CNNs).,
We demonstrate that Inception-v4 dra- matically improves on simple CNN baseline.,
"Our experiments suggest that it also out- performs custom CNN architectures that was used in previous studies for 4 class clas- sification, when extensive data augmentation strategy is applied.",
"Interestingly, good results (89% accuracy on 4 class classification task) can be obtained without using spe- cialized staining image normalization methods, contrary to all previous results on sim- ilar datasets.",
