"Springer Nature 2021 LATEX template Learning Curves for Decision Making in Supervised Machine Learning: A Survey Felix Mohr1* and Jan N. van Rijn2 1Universidad de La Sabana, Ch´ıa, Cundinamarca, Colombia.",
