"Conclusion In this paper, we introduce a new threat, termed “neural pla- giarism”, in which diffusion models plagiarize copyrighted images while bypassing protections like watermarking.",
"We propose a universal attack pipeline that enables both forgery and ambiguity attacks, resulting in effective data plagia- rism.",
"Withe extensive experiments, our approach is ef- fective to evade copyright protections ranging from visible copyrighted images to invisible watermarking.",
