Roig also specifies as many as 27 detailed guidelines to avoid plagiarism.,
"consider the plagiarism taxonomy within four mutually complementary aspects: the plagiarism source, the plagiarism method, the plagiarism object and the extrinsic aspect of plagiarism (Joy et al., 2009).",
