Paraphrasing P Text or Math rewording 1354 133 Insertions and ID Insert or delete 766 21 Deletions text/math expressions Substitutions S Substitute a term/expression 94 2 or replace by cross reference Text to Math/ TMMT Math formulae explained 164 1 Math to Text with text words or vice versa Diﬀerent DP Objects with the same meaning 733 20 Presentation but diﬀerent presentations Formula FM Substituting formulae with a diﬀerent repr.,
