"Advanced Computing: An International Journal ( ACIJ ), Vol.3, No.4, July 2012 DOI : 10.5121/acij.2012.3403 21 ‘CodeAliker’ - Plagiarism Detection on the Cloud Nitish Upreti1 and Rishi Kumar2 Department of Computer Science and Engineering, AMITY University, Noida, India.",
