"MSN Search AntiPlag Essay and course material database Hermetic detection Grahpical user interface In the final phase, those source documents that appear only in one match area that is shorter than 50 characters are filtered out from the results.",
The aim of the filtering is to lower the number of coincidental matches between document d and web sources.,
"Finally, a list of inspected documents is displayed to the user with the information on the total percentage of the text that is suspected of being plagiarized in each document.",
"If the percentage of plagiarized text in a document is equal or higher than 25%, AntiPlag considers it as a severe case of plagiarism and alerts the user.",
The user can then inspect the document using the graphical view that highlights the suspected instances of plagiarism.,
The user can open the suspected sources by clicking the links provided with each highlighted area.,
Figure 3 gives an example of the result view.,
