Plagiarism Retrieval Search Engine The core of the figure plagiarism detection system is the plagiarism retrieval search engine.,
The search engines receive a user query in the form of sample figure.,
It takes the sample figure and pre-processes it to build the query vector that will be compared with the figure-document vectors on the metadata database.,
Similarity between the query vector and each figure-document is calculated using the cosine similarity measure.,
"The most similar figures are retrieved from the database using their figure id, ranked and presented to the user.",
