The core concept of the paper has remained the same throughout: an in- tricate inception experiment.,
"On the outer shell, the whole paper is an AI experiment to showcase to what extent ChatGPT – with suitable guidance – can carry out all the steps involved in scientific research, including literature review, conceptualizing ideas, developing analysis and results, and presenting material formatted for publication.",
"Under the hood of this general premise, I let ChatGPT run its own experiment of generating new ‘scientific’ concepts in the abstract environment of theoretical physics.",
"The name GPT4, which char- acterizes the main ‘outcome’ of the combined experiment demonstrated in the paper, was invented well before OpenAI released their GPT-4 version of Chat- GPT (not used in this paper), and it was named as such because it results from a generalized probabilistic theory (GPT #1) enhanced by a generative pretrained transformer module (GPT #2), created by the state-of-the-art language model ChatGPT (GPT #3) within a virtual environment set in the space of physical theories (GPT #4).",
This is what is referred to as a “four-fold integration” in 22 the body of the paper.,
