"Need of AI in Modern Education: in the Eyes of Explainable AI (xAI) Supriya Manna, Niladri Sett∗ SRM University AP Amaravati, Andhra Pradesh 522502, India 1 Abstract Modern Education is not Modern without AI.",
"However, AI’s complex nature makes understand- ing and fixing problems challenging.",
