(3) Adjust the Threshold • Select Image →Adjust →Threshold.... • Use the sliders to select only the circles (they should appear in red).,
• Click ”Apply.” (4) Convert to Binary Image • Select Process →Binary →Make Binary to create a black-and-white im- age.,
(5) Perform Particle Analysis 1We used ChatGPT 4o and ImageJ 1.54g in this tutorial.,
