A message box pops up asking the user to select the input file.,
The file dialog then opens for the user to browse and select the required input file.,
This improvement enhances clarity and guides the user through the process.,
(vi) A feature to output predicted values for the test data through the GUI was implemented.,
"In NIMO, setting the output_res argument to True allows the output of predicted values, variance values, and acquisition function values for the test data.",
