"Lemma 2 For any real values 0 ≤p,q,r ≤1 and 0 < k ≤1, the following inequality is true: T(p,q,r) = log2 ␀|p −q|k + 1  + log2 ␀|q −r|k + 1  −log2 ␀|p −r|k + 1  ≥0 (8) Proof.",
