"The reports were categorized into four distinct groups based on their content and characteristics, as outlined in Table 1.",
"To provide a better understanding, Table 2 presents a sample dataset for each class, illustrating examples from each category.",
This sample dataset demonstrates the diversity and representation of the different classes within the analyzed records.,
