The SBERT model receives a fixed length of sentence as input.,
"Therefore, we used padding and truncating for the appropriate representations of all input to the maximum length that was 510.",
"In the padding approach, for sentences that are shorter than the maximum length, the model adds empty tokens to the sentences to make up the length.",
