"It consists of the diﬀerence ""Alphabet Compression (AD)"" - ""Potential Distortion (PD)"".",
"The subject of the present work is PD, which measures the informative divergence between viewing the data through visualization with information loss and reading the data without any information loss.",
In [11] an expression based on Kullback-Leibler (KL) divergence was used for PD.,
"Since the KL divergence is unbounded, PD can be arbitrarily large.",
