1 is measured using: Beneﬁt = AC−PD = H (Zi)−H (Zi+1)−DKL(Z′ i||Zi) (2) where H () is the Shannon entropy of an alphabet and DKL() is KL- divergence of an alphabet from a reference alphabet.,
