"Based PMF Q, we expect to have divergence values in the order of C > D > A ≫B.",
"DJS, Dk=2 new , Dk=1 ncm , and Dk=2 ncm have produced values in that order, while Dk=1 new indicates an order of A > D > C ≫B.",
"This order cannot be interpreted easily, indicating a weakness of Dk=1 new .",
