"(5.1) Once this claim is proven, the proof of the result readily follows from (5.1), as then one can write Z Ω Z Ω g(x, y)|f(y) −f(x)|pdxdy ≥ Z U Z V g(x, y)|f(y) −f(x)|pdxdy ≥cδ|U||V | = +∞.",
"36 Hence, it only remains to prove the claim.",
