"Indeed, if this were not to be the case, one would prove that the measure of Ωis accumulated on the preimage of a ball which we could make arbitrarily small, and hence |Ω| = |f−1({v})| for a certain v ∈Rm, which would contradict the fact that f is not a.e.",
equal to a constant.,
