"Then by definition |f(x) −v1| ≤r for a. e. x ∈U, from which, by the triangle’s inequality |f(x) −v2| ≥|v1 −v2| −|f(x) −v1| ≥2r −r = r for a. e. x ∈U, and |f(y) −v2| ≤r/2 for a. e. y ∈V.",
