"6 Applications to variational problems This section is devoted to the proofs of Theorems 1.7 and 1.8, which rely on the theory that has been developed in Subsections 2.1 and 2.2 and follow the standard scheme of the Direct Method.",
The reader is referred to those subsections as well as the introduction (Section 1) for notations.,
