Proof of Theorem 1.7.,
"As F is proper and bounded from below, −∞< m∗< +∞, where, recall that m∗= inf u∈NLBVω(Ω)∩Lq(Ω) Iω(u).",
Let (un)n∈N be a minimizing sequence for Iω in NLBVω(Ω)∩Lq(Ω).,
