"Nonlocal Retinex-Based Variational Model and its Deep Unfolding Twin for Low-Light Image Enhancement Daniel Torres1*, Joan Duran1, Julia Navarro1, Catalina Sbert1 1*Dpt.",
"Mathematics and Computer Science and IAC3, Universitat de les Illes Balears, Cra.",
"de Valldemossa, km.",
