"Super-Resolution of Sentinel-2 Images Using a Geometry-Guided Back-Projection Network with Self-Attention I. Pereira-S´anchez, D. Torres, F. Alcover, B. Garau, J. Navarro, C. Sbert, J. Duran aDpt.",
