"participated in a research testing different heat-sensing devices in Cancer therapy, Swearingen in 1965 concluded two main things, first, the true positives rates was greatly increased when mammography and thermography were applied together, second, the thermography was seen as a new technique for diagnostic procedure in mass screening of the breast [43].",
