"InceptionV3, InceptionResNetV2, Xception and two VGGNet models.",
The obtained results are com- pared with different existing stain-normalization techniques.,
We started our experiments by examining the effect of the stain normalization on performance.,
The performance of all architectures are evaluated based on the overall prediction accuracy.,
The obtained results of the plain architectures are summarized in Table III.,
