"D. Comparative analysis of accuracy with other methods For evaluating the effectiveness of the proposed method, a comparative analysis with the results of some of the previously published work from the same dataset is presented in Table V. It can be observed from Table V that the methods in [16], [14], [19], [18] and [15] give an accuracy of 87.50%, 87.20%, 81.25%,79.20%, and 79.00% respectively, whereas, the results obtained using the network architecture used here, give an accuracy of 92.50%.",
These results conﬁrm the superiority of our learner in terms of accuracy compared to other similar methods.,
