This result indicates that our EfﬁcientNetV2-SA network performs better than traditional machine learning classiﬁers on the task of classifying breast cancer images on all factors.,
The result of EfﬁcientNetV2- S is closer to that of ResNet-50.,
"However, EfﬁcientNetV2-SA show signiﬁcant improvements on the basis of EfﬁcientNetV2- S, which are 6.4%, 0.4%, 1.4% and 0.5% on 40X, 100X, 200X and 400X datasets respectively.",
We also test our model’s accuracy on each single type breast cancer and compare it with EfﬁcientNetV2-S.,
