"Figure 7 shows the overlaps between the expert game gene set, the 21 genes used in the OncotypeDx test (Paik, 2007), the 70 genes in the Mammaprint test (van 't Veer, et al., 2002), 100 genes recently identified via Random Forest analysis (RFRS) (Griffith, et al., 2013), and 94 genes recently identified via the Attractor Metagenes approach (Cheng, et al., 2013b).",
