"Due to the large quantity of data, the majority of research efforts employing this dataset use only a subset of these images to showcase experimental results.",
"Unlike those efforts, we use the entire DUKE dataset for a comprehensive analysis and incorporate a data- splitting methodology to investigate potential disparities in patient selection for the training set.",
