(Tanno et al.,
"2018) proposes a DNN architecture by adaptively grow- ing from primitive blocks while representation learning into edges, routing functions and leaf nodes.",
TabNet differs from these as it embeds soft feature selection with controllable sparsity via sequential attention.,
