"4 ML Framework and Model Conﬁguration To examine how diﬀerent ML paradigms perform for plume shine dose prediction, three representative regression models were selected: RF, XGBoost, and TabNet.",
"Together, these models cover the main approaches currently used for structured tabular data, namely ensemble learning, boosted decision trees, and attention-based DL model.",
