"To monitor the performance of the model, we use a list of metrics, including Accuracy, AUC, Recall, Precision, and F1 score.",
"We also use ModelCheckpoint callback to monitor validation accuracy and save the weights of the model, EarlyStopping to stop training if there was no improvement in validation loss after 10 epochs, and ReducLROn- Plateau to reduce the learning rate if there was no change in validation loss after 10 epochs.",
We first train our models with 5-fold cross-validation to find the optimal number of epochs 17 (iterations) and then evaluate them using our test dataset.,
