"In the study, we have trained dense neural networks of different numbers of layers and neurons.",
Each dense layer except the last one was followed by batch normalization to improve generalization.,
TabNet [12] is an architecture for working with tabular data.,
"In TabNet architecture, the data are processed in steps in which the reasoning is performed based on features selected using the attentive mechanism.",
"The parameters tested in the study were the number of steps and the gamma value, which determines how independent the reasoning is between the steps.",
"Data preprocessing Before training the algorithm, the dataset underwent prepro- cessing.",
"Missing values were imputed using the KNN imputer provided by the sklearn library, and the variables were scaled to a 0–1 range.",
